<title>PHILIPPINES: ING Manila branch 1996 net about $21 mln.</title>
<headline>ING Manila branch 1996 net about $21 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Bank's Philippine branch said on Friday it had a net income of about $21 million in 1996, up 25 percent from $16.9 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>Country manager Renato de Guzman said the earnings were derived from bond trading and treasury operations. He did not give the exact profit figure.</p>
<p>De Guzman said as of December 18 last year, the bank had total assets of 22 billion pesos.</p>
<p>ING Bank is one of ten banks given commercial bank licences by the Philippine Central Bank in 1995.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8938 Fax 817 6267</p>
